// The enemy AI's numbers (ticket 0501). Loaded by trpg_content::ai; the rules
// that use them are in trpg_core::ai. Every number is *tunable*: difficulty
// feel is judged in playtest (0804).
//
// An attack's score (the AI makes the highest-scoring attack it can):
//   damage  × expected HP dealt
// + kill    × chance the target falls (0 to 1)
// + lord    if the target is a lord
// − risk    × expected HP taken from the counter
// + terrain × (Def + Avoid / 10) of the tile it attacks from
// Expected values use the forecast's displayed hit chances, follow-ups
// included, crits ignored.
//
// Enemies carry no consumables and never drink potions (Nick,
// docs/design/weapons-and-items.md); only healer units heal.
(
    damage: 10,
    kill: 300,
    lord: 50,
    risk: 5,
    terrain: 5,
)
